{"id":"a0c01cc59de986a3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SubstP.md","title":"SubstP","display":"SubstP","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SubstP","parameters":["s","a","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SubstP"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>s</span><span>a</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>s</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>同步命题替换；存在的是固定公式集合上的图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SubstP s a b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists f\n  (exists w\n    (exists h\n      (and\n        (@ FormSetP f)\n        (and\n          (@ Omega w)\n          (and\n            (@ Map s w f)\n            (and\n              (@ Map h f f)\n              (and\n                (in a f)\n                (and\n                  (@ App h a b)\n                  (and\n                    (forall n\n                      (forall t (implies (and (@ Nat n) (@ PAtom n t)) (forall u (iff (@ App h t u) (@ App s n u))))))\n                    (and\n                      (forall z150\n                        (forall z151\n                          (forall z154\n                            (implies\n                            (and (in z150 f) (and (in z151 f) (@ PImp z150 z151 z154)))\n                            (exists z152\n                            (exists z153\n                            (exists z155\n                            (and (@ App h z150 z152) (and (@ App h z151 z153) (and (@ PImp z152 z153 z155) (@ App h z154 z155)))))))))))\n                      (and\n                        (forall z156\n                          (forall z157\n                            (forall z160\n                            (implies\n                            (and (in z156 f) (and (in z157 f) (@ PAnd z156 z157 z160)))\n                            (exists z158\n                            (exists z159\n                            (exists z161\n                            (and (@ App h z156 z158) (and (@ App h z157 z159) (and (@ PAnd z158 z159 z161) (@ App h z160 z161)))))))))))\n                        (forall z162\n                          (forall z163\n                            (forall z166\n                            (implies\n                            (and (in z162 f) (and (in z163 f) (@ POr z162 z163 z166)))\n                            (exists z164\n                            (exists z165\n                            (exists z167\n                            (and (@ App h z162 z164) (and (@ App h z163 z165) (and (@ POr z164 z165 z167) (@ App h z166 z167)))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599bf36b101ed1fe\" href=\"?note=599bf36b101ed1fe\" title=\"ZFC_FormSetP\">FormSetP</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" href=\"?note=635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" title=\"ZFC_PAnd\">PAnd</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627a